geom_from divides n_ff by the world before the plugin's own split runs,
and 640 does not divide by 3. The plugin cuts the routed experts' width by
whole fp8 blocks and parity at any world up to the block count (1.0.8),
so the refusal is answered before it is asked. geom_from gains
arch_splits_ff (default off): with it, a width the world does not divide
is left whole in g.n_ff for the plugin to slice; a width that divides is
unaffected, and every other plugin keeps the refusal because for them
g.n_ff is the per-rank width. qwen4exp opts in.
